Results
The completed stages and verification outcomes are summarized below:

◆ Architecture: AVSDPLL → RVMyth → AVSDDAC
◆ RTL simulation: Functional behavior verified with Icarus Verilog + GTKWave
◆ Synthesis: RTL converted to a SKY130 technology-mapped gate-level netlist
◆ Post-synthesis simulation: Gate-level functionality verified successfully
◆ Verification: RTL and synthesized waveforms showed the expected functional activity
